      "content": "Implemented session-scoped streaming update attribution for Ralph iterations.\n- Replaced shared mutable sessionIterationMap approach with createSessionUpdateLogger(acpSessionId, iteration, logUpdate).\n- Each ACP session now registers a logger that captures iteration in closure and ignores updates from other session IDs.\n- Logging callback now safely swallows both sync and async logging failures.\n- Updated helper tests in tests/ralph.test.ts to cover session-bound attribution and logger error swallowing.\nVerification: npm test -- tests/ralph.test.ts (141 passed)."
